WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.300
Narrator: Service must be the same at every phase.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.600
Narrator: On the Last Mile, spot fans who look lost before they ask.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:15.000
Narrator: At the gate, a smile comes before the scan - and if they're at the wrong gate, show them the way.

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.300
Narrator: On the concourse at half-time, keep answers short and keep people moving.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.300
Narrator: At the seats, read the ticket with them and point to the block sign.

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.400
Narrator: And at departure, after a long match, give the same warm help: 'Metro is that way - safe journey home.'

7
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.800
Narrator: The fan should feel the same welcome at the last minute as at the first.

